voxwright

Parts of this repository are derived from mcbuilder, the Python tool at
https://github.com/lzif/mcbuilder, which is licensed under the MIT License.
The derived parts are:

  packages/mcbuilder/src        the TypeScript port of mcbuilder's modules
  packages/mcbuilder/bin        the mcbuild command
  packages/mcbuilder/examples   the example build scripts, ported from Python
  packages/mcbuilder/test       tests ported from mcbuilder's test suite
  packages/render/src           the renderer, previews and guide ported from
                                mcbuilder's render, guide and views modules
                                (the WebGL and section-mesher code under
                                packages/render/src/mesh and
                                packages/render/src/webgl is new)
  packages/core/src/blocks      block string parsing, ported from mcbuilder
  packages/core/src/rotation    structure rotation, ported from mcbuilder
  vectors/export_*.py           scripts that call mcbuilder to export vectors
  vectors/*.json                the golden vectors those scripts write

